          "evidences": [
            {
              "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000250"
            }
          ],
          "value": "Involved in the control of phototaxis. Mediates both photoattractant (in the orange light) and photophobic (in the near UV light) responses. The signal is then transmitted to the sensory rhodopsin I transducer (HTR-I) (By similarity)"
        }
      ],
